# SPL Queries

## Successful logons (Event ID 4624)
---
EventCode=4624
| stats count by Account_Name, Logon_Type
---
Shows which accounts log on successfully and how (interactive, network, remote desktop).

## Cleared security log (Event ID 1102)
---
EventCode="1102"
| stats count, latest(_time) as last_cleared by Account_Name, host
| convert ctime(last_cleared)
| sort - last_cleared
---
Detects when the Security audit log is cleared, a common way to cover tracks.
